The platform evaluates:

- Whether the event was ingested.
- Whether the detection rule triggered.
- Whether the threat was classified.
- Whether an incident was created.
- Whether the correct agent was assigned.
- Whether the response recommendation was generated.
- Whether the approval workflow operated correctly.

