NIST+1



## 25. Audit and observability

Implement three separate but connected systems.

Application logs

- API errors.
- Service events.
- Authentication events.
- Background worker errors.

Security audit records

- User actions.
- Agent actions.
- Permission checks.
- Approvals.
- Configuration changes.
- Response executions.

Operational telemetry

- Request latency.
- Database performance.
- Agent execution duration.
- Workflow failures.
- Queue depth.
- CPU and memory usage.
- Connector availability.

Use OpenTelemetry-compatible instrumentation to correlate distributed requests and workflow execution.&#x20;

